etried the rollback; it completed in all three regions.\n- Verified: all regions now on **v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%**.\n\n**Incident:** Opened **INC-0001 (SEV2)** for checkout-api describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the post-rollback state, and follow-ups. The create call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it had been created, so I did not retry (avoiding a duplicate page).\n\n**Follow-ups for the on-call:** root-cause v2.3.1 before any redeploy, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}